otocol_full_draft_selection:2520cb526f39d5a003aab5f7","span_id":"span_sel_31_ep"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要研究目的：评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。","quote_sha256":"91f9668c833c01c737e00948c18613521366f596752872eef9fc69a09e681b8f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_primary_obj"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"0726a50bb0c8f1c5ec79b9e21b343bfd08fddc0a595315a5c8e3769df01ce9a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_primary_ep"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"估计目标策略：治疗策略人群为所有随机受试者；比较第16周PASI 75应答。停药或使用救援治疗按复合策略判定为无应答，其他缺失数据采用无应答填补；报告组间率差及95%置信区间。","quote_sha256":"44f71070d9cdb5b6b69ad6feeeb7fbfeef4aad105693eaa3500bedd537f18414","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_estimand"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。不开展期中分析。","quote_sha256":"ccd7b348358b71793f3761994bf0e928e73abcd319f577b74f5285d5c99e3b7c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_stats"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_31_obj","span_sel_31_ep","span_sd_primary_obj","span_sd_primary_ep","span_sd_visits","span_sd_estimand","span_sd_stats"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"heading":"主要目的和主要终点","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的主要目的为评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效，对应的主要终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答的受试者比例。PASI 75应答定义为较基线PASI评分改善≥75%；PASI评分于基线及第4、8、12、16周进行评价，主要终点以第16周相对基线的PASI改善情况判定。","rationale":"主要目的、主要终点及其PASI评价时点有已确认研究事实直接支持，并与本小节现有正文一致。主要终点的估计目标、缺失数据处理与统计推断要点在方案中的呈现位置需由项目确认，建议医学作者与统计人员核对后确定是否在本小节展开。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（主要目的和主要终点），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_db5f25e7dd5b8877","section_number":"3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2520cb526f39d5a003aab5f7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:21fb7445eed9f6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b9f50aa913504"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921213411_182a6852","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"探索性目的和探索性终点","missing_source_classes":["经项目确认的探索性目的与探索性终点定义","研究者手册或既往临床研究资料","探索性分析计划（如生物标志物或药代动力学等）"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"允许来源未定义探索性目的与探索性终点，缺少可引用的项目事实，无法生成有证据支持的正文；医学作者需核对项目是否已有经确认的探索性目的与终点，以及研究者手册、既往临床研究资料或探索性分析计划等支持材料。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_9e670d193fbbb761","section_number":"3.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2520cb526f39d5a003aab5f7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","c