n_sd_intrinsic"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"总体研究设计：平行组（parallel assignment）、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机","quote_sha256":"671a62a354113705569b311f82cdff13e6dc35ab5faac84b8993f18ac7fe7ebc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_center"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"随机化方式：随机分配","quote_sha256":"a0b434e0929aba98b91027a87aab6b9dc58df4c52aeb8d9e9de686bf28f2cd5a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_randomization"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"对照措施：匹配安慰剂","quote_sha256":"1cafd7b3b8755010d178eb3fa7d8660de3d2c9f3a15eedfd1f8bbf4194f91a9b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_comparator"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"对照：匹配安慰剂对照；试验组与安慰剂组按1:1随机分配，双盲治疗16周。","quote_sha256":"bcf69f1343deaa3b4cd6b8ab0fd4fbac84bf974c3118292b17999b1ba93aa172","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_ratio"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"目标研究人群：成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者","quote_sha256":"a1f2b59730f1d08cde8f6a85d4179e62887b3729f4175c98334b9dafda33e808","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_population"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄≥18岁；确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。","quote_sha256":"3e9ca06af65f6aeb7e28df97f2a93f40d8966553fa5faff3f806e43f762999dd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_inclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f3eff5ef57b4691ff025db695140e4ead682562786c0dec621edcd256ef28af3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_intervention"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"剂量与给药方案：合成试验药A：100 mg，每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"e97da70f0c9a5d6f604a29b6c054d0ed03fc9fd60470293f55ab4afbebddcff0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_dose"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_epochs"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"0726a50bb0c8f1c5ec79b9e21b343bfd08fddc0a595315a5c8e3769df01ce9a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_primary_ep"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"样本量策略：假设第16周PASI 75应答率试验组为60%、安慰剂组为30%，双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机，并考虑15%脱落，共计划入组132例（每组66例）。","quote_sha256":"2088842f2548655845b43f017bb904dc2663a94d1a5c7a802e7adf8daa68b0d2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_sample"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"期中分析是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"31ef70e7f5cd03d6c17b90802e7352c6e81b5fdc853989b74ea1499901f514a4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_interim_no"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"样本量再估计是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"913a62236e4f4332a7188562f2625d53aa7f770cea155664564c5fb821a98efd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_reest_no"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sd_title","span_sd_indication","span_sd_phase","span_sd_region","span_sd_intrinsic","span_sd_design","span_sd_center","span_sd_randomization","span_sd_comparator","span_sd_ratio","span_sd_population","span_sd_inclusion","span_sd_intervention","span_sd_dose","span_sd_epochs","span_sd_visits","span_sd_primary_ep","span_sd_sample","span_sd_interim_no","span_sd_reest_no"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":20},"heading":"研究设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为在中国开展的多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组设计的III期确证性临床研究，目标人群为确诊为斑块状银屑病、疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者（年龄≥18岁）。研究计划入组132例受试者（每组66例），按1:1随机分配至试验药组或对照组：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服、每日一次，对照组接受匹配安慰剂，双盲治疗期均为16周，给药持续至第16周。研究包含筛选期（最长4周）、双盲治疗期（16周）和安全性随访期（4周）三个阶段。受试者在筛选完成后于基线/第1天随机，第2、4、8、12、16周接受治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访；PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。治疗期间通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性。主要疗效终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。样本量估算假设第16周PASI 75应答率试验组为60%、安慰剂组为30%，采用双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机，并考虑15%脱落。本研究不开展期中分析，也不进行样本量再估计。","rationale":"总体设计（多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组）、1:1随机分配、试验药100 mg每日一次口服与匹配安慰剂、筛选期最长4周、双盲治疗期16周、安全性随访期4周、访视与评价时点、样本量132例（每组66例）及其估算假设、不开展期中分析与样本量再估计均有已确认研究事实直接支持。医学作者需核对随机化实施细节（如分层因素、区组大小）、盲法维持与盲底管理安排，并确认本章与其他章节表述一致。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（α、期中分析、样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（研究设计），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1741b1557c67abd7","section_number":"4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2520cb526f39d5a003aab5f7","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:21fb7445eed9f6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b9f50aa913504"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:2520cb526f39d5a003aab5f7","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:2520cb526f39d5a003aab5f7","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"93840d460fbf8d92b1dbf188662859f1b30c9e2cc4ddfbbc950d117ebaef7dcf"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:8.4.9.2 不良事件|block:1136|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"a4dbbca5ee93dd8afdc70483dd7648214180490ccefcd4eceab6680c02415d81"},{"locator":"section:7.3.1 病例报告表的设计|block:1037|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"a081fa03f5ce0ceb2ca2444ea6b2a850997611938884f75fa4f6b5e188b3af68"},{"locator":"section:统计分析单位签字页|block:57|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"288c4151aa03e0bb0feffeb19ae4b67d399ea214ab90d8f02d3dd67800bdd070"},{"locator":"section:统计分析单位签字页|block:56|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:21fb7445eed9f6","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"ce0d2dfe125632cc5d7e00e964022f9cd73382987f5a821bb4cc70694b086ad9"},{"locator":"section:研究目的和终点|block:321|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b9f50aa913504","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"67acce9109ac9afcabc94dc949b010c17d925d27ae49d9aaf0c358c3c7d229e1"}]}